1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,360
Motivation is a liar.

2
00:00:02,360 --> 00:00:03,020
It gets you excited

3
00:00:03,020 --> 00:00:04,040
for a week,

4
00:00:04,040 --> 00:00:05,340
and then it abandons

5
00:00:05,340 --> 00:00:06,320
you the second things

6
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:07,500
get hard.

7
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:09,000
Discipline doesn't care how

8
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:09,980
you feel.

9
00:00:09,980 --> 00:00:11,100
Discipline wakes up when

10
00:00:11,100 --> 00:00:12,300
you're exhausted,

11
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:12,920
does the work when

12
00:00:12,920 --> 00:00:14,400
nobody is watching,

13
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:15,160
and keeps you moving

14
00:00:15,160 --> 00:00:16,180
forward when the fire

15
00:00:16,180 --> 00:00:17,580
goes out.

16
00:00:17,580 --> 00:00:18,640
Feelings change,

17
00:00:18,640 --> 00:00:21,140
but habits build empires.

18
00:00:21,140 --> 00:00:21,920
Stop waiting to feel

19
00:00:21,920 --> 00:00:23,220
ready and start acting

20
00:00:23,220 --> 00:00:24,140
like someone who has

21
00:00:24,140 --> 00:00:25,300
a mission.

22
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:27,080
Action creates momentum,

23
00:00:27,080 --> 00:00:28,400
not mood.
